== Notes ==
* Sometimes, several {{e|Lump}}s, {{e|Guts}}, {{e|Para-Bite}}s, or {{e|Round Worm}}s can accompany Scolex at the start of the battle.

== Trivia ==
* Scolex appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* Scolex is the only Boss to have ''lost'' access to a Champion variant in an update. Specifically in ''Repentance,'' where his dark grey counterpart is inaccessible unless using Console commands to summon it.
* Scolex can be considered an [[edmundm:68071175738|older or younger]] version of {{e|Pin}}, but not a posthumous one (that title goes to {{e|The Frail}}).
* A [[Wikipedia:Cestoda#Scolex|scolex]] is the name of the head of a tapeworm.
* Compared to the original ''Binding of Isaac'', Scolex's head and tail attacks are swapped.
** He also has 3 more body segments than in the original.
* Scolex bears some resemblance to a mythological [http://cryptidz.wikia.com/wiki/Mongolian_Death_Worm Mongolian Death Worm], which are described as long, scaly, and blood red. It also raises half its body out of the sand and covers its prey with a lethal acidic substance, which is somewhat similar to Scolex's head attack.

