{{bug|If the final vulnerable segment of Scolex's tail is destroyed using the {{p|Chaos Card}}, the boss will glitch and become harder to kill. The tail will appear again if his head gets bombed or he hits Isaac.}}
{{bug|If Scolex is [[Petrification|petrified]] (with {{i|Mom's Contacts}} or other similar items) when it is in mid-air, any segment of its body can be damaged.}}
{{bug|dlc=a+|If Scolex is under the effects of {{i|Broken Modem}} in mid-air, his jump will be stopped and he will fall.}}
{{bug|If Scolex is frozen with {{i|Midas' Touch}} or {{i|Dad's Ring}} and attacked, he can split into two halves, one with his head and one with his tail.}}

